Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.92,0:00:05.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my life, it's your life!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.10,0:00:08.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Fightin' for tomorrow, go\Ncatch what you really want!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.22,0:00:10.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I want more, anyone more?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.28,0:00:12.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, walkin' up the door!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.14,0:00:15.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my life, it's your life!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.56,0:00:17.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Run like a wind, jump high, yeah, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.62,0:00:19.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you're strong!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.36,0:00:21.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Believe you can achieve your goal!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.72,0:00:24.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's keep on going. I'll not stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.36,0:00:45.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's do it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.68,0:00:47.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You know what I mean, baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.54,0:00:50.04,Default,,0,0,0,,No one can make my dream come true!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.12,0:00:51.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you feel it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.36,0:00:55.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I really don't know what is\NSomething is testing me every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.28,0:00:56.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.64,0:00:57.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's fly away.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.56,0:01:00.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I know I never wanna come back here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.66,0:01:01.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.88,0:01:04.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's fly away. The\Ngreat end of the unknown.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.80,0:01:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Standing up. Blowing up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.52,0:01:09.64,Default,,0,0,0,,My dream is getting wilder.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.72,0:01:12.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not afraid, beat me, hit me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.70,0:01:15.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I will never turn around.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.22,0:01:17.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Another day, another chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.00,0:01:20.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You know it's never too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.18,0:01:22.40,Default,,0,0,0,,If I can do it, so can you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.36,0:01:28.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my life, it's your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.56,0:01:31.56,Default,,0,0,0,,But if you don't want to\Nget what you really want.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.64,0:01:33.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I want more, anyone more.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.74,0:01:35.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, open up the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.80,0:01:38.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my life. It's your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.00,0:01:40.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Run like a wind, jump high.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.52,0:01:42.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you're strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.72,0:01:45.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Believe you can't achieve your goal.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.30,0:01:47.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's keep on going, roaring.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.14,0:01:49.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my life, it's your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.46,0:01:52.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Fighting for your eyes that\NI want, but you really want.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.54,0:01:57.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I want more, anyone more,\Ncome on, open up the gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.42,0:02:01.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my life, it's your life,\Nshine like a star to be good.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.62,0:02:06.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you're strong. Just that\Nyou can't achieve your best.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.34,0:02:08.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's keep on going. Out of day.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.60,0:02:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You make my day every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.62,0:02:42.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you ever shattered your blade before?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.74,0:02:43.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.14,0:02:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It's happened a couple of times.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.26,0:02:49.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Cracked a few of them fighting you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.06,0:02:51.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Infused with Haki.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.82,0:02:55.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Those swords would have been\Nable to withstand the stress.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.96,0:02:59.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You must carry every\Nnick as a mark of shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.06,0:03:02.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Any sword can become a black blade!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.04,0:03:04.58,Default,,0,0,0,,A black blade?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.06,0:03:08.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Until you master this, no liquor Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.02,0:03:17.72,Default,,0,0,0,,No nicks on the edge.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.60,0:03:30.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Are there any casualties reported?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.58,0:03:32.41,Default,,0,0,0,,No, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.84,0:03:34.25,Default,,0,0,0,,All thanks to your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.38,0:03:36.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Your quick thinking saved\Na lot of lives today.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.82,0:03:39.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Suspending gravity on the\Nfalling debris was brilliant.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.06,0:03:44.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Luckily, we had time to react since we\Nhad a lot of the evacuees gathered here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.78,0:03:46.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm relieved to hear that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.20,0:03:48.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.20,0:03:50.54,Default,,0,0,0,,The giant statue was split into two.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.82,0:03:53.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Does that mean one of the\Nexecutives was defeated?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.54,0:03:56.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Dinko was taken out!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.86,0:04:01.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe someone with power\Nlike that didn't enter the tournament.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.78,0:04:03.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Must be a humble guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.58,0:04:06.35,Default,,0,0,0,,And he's a mere subordinate\Nto Garp's grandson.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.04,0:04:08.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha, ha, ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.52,0:04:09.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta hand it to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.96,0:04:13.96,Default,,0,0,0,,King Rick has been saved, so I\Nsuppose I'll let him slide this once.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.66,0:04:18.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.88,0:04:22.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's the factory.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.38,0:04:26.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Something caused it to burst into flames.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.44,0:04:27.50,Default,,0,0,0,,How'd that happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.16,0:04:36.00,Default,,0,0,0,,We ready for one more?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.08,0:04:37.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.56,0:04:44.84,Default,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.04,0:04:47.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Put it to the ground!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.52,0:04:48.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It made us suffer!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.30,0:04:52.65,Default,,0,0,0,,That'll be the last time\Njerk tricks us into slavery!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.40,0:05:01.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.40,0:05:06.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like Pika was taken down and now\Nthe factory's been set on fire, Kofi!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.48,0:05:12.06,Default,,0,0,0,,But what they don't\Nquite realize yet is our
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.14,0:05:15.58,Default,,0,0,0,,defeated can revive and our\Nfactory can be repaired.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.94,0:05:21.40,Default,,0,0,0,,That's because we still have Mon Cherie on\Nour side with the heal-heal fruit power!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.92,0:05:26.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Rebecca!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.83,0:05:27.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Taka!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.90,0:05:29.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Robin Wind!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.62,0:05:30.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.04,0:05:41.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, is that really you, Commander Keros?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.84,0:05:44.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, you've rescued the princess, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.06,0:05:48.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You look so valiant, even\Nmore than the statue!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.12,0:05:50.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You flatter me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.32,0:05:54.50,Default,,0,0,0,,My goodness, you've been terribly injured.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.58,0:05:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Please allow me to heal you at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.98,0:05:57.81,Default,,0,0,0,,One moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.48,0:06:00.34,Default,,0,0,0,,So you're Princess Muncheri.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.00,0:06:03.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I've heard word of your\Nremarkable ability,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.66,0:06:07.52,Default,,0,0,0,,but there must be a limit on\Nits use, not wasted on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.32,0:06:09.72,Default,,0,0,0,,But you're wounded.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.08,0:06:11.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Just let me help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.98,0:06:13.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.24,0:06:14.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm conscious, aren't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.72,0:06:16.30,Default,,0,0,0,,More importantly, you're safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.38,0:06:18.15,Default,,0,0,0,,It must have been hard on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.26,0:06:20.48,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're set on using your power to help,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.56,0:06:24.38,Default,,0,0,0,,There are going to be countless\Ncitizens who need you more than I
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.58,0:06:47.82,Default,,0,0,0,,This is really our home.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.06,0:06:51.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Leo mentioned that the situation was dire,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.78,0:06:55.34,Default,,0,0,0,,but I didn't expect something\Nlike this. At least we
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.42,0:06:59.56,Default,,0,0,0,,successfully destroyed the\Nfactory The final clash is upon us
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.40,0:07:05.18,Default,,0,0,0,,The kingdom has long suffered under\NDoflamingo's clutches. It shall either
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.26,0:07:10.34,Default,,0,0,0,,be liberated and returned to King\NRick Or once again fall into despair
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.58,0:07:18.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Her last line of hope lies\Namong a pirate crew now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.66,0:07:19.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.08,0:07:25.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Our fate shall be decided.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.24,0:07:30.94,Default,,0,0,0,,At the royal palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.18,0:07:37.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Save us, Lawland.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.88,0:07:41.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Lufieland This is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.08,0:07:42.76,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all on them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.76,0:07:44.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.28,0:07:46.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Try that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.22,0:07:48.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.60,0:08:17.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, I infiltrated the Rampart Tower.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.50,0:08:21.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Things are looking dicey in here, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.00,0:08:23.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you make it to me, Sabo?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.20,0:08:28.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm helping some of the trapped\Nprisoners escape the Coliseum grounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.20,0:08:30.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but you're way too far from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.48,0:08:34.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I know for a fact you've handled much\Ntougher missions than this, Koala.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.38,0:08:36.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't call if this was a cakewalk.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.38,0:08:39.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy might be at risk to be right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.02,0:08:41.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, sorrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.98,0:08:43.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you need a hand?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.06,0:08:45.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.42,0:08:46.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Not even a scratch.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.38,0:09:07.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I was scared!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.80,0:09:08.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought you might die!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.98,0:09:12.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, I was more afraid\Nthat I might die, so thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.32,0:09:14.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir Zoro, splendid work back there!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.54,0:09:15.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, thank you, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.80,0:09:16.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.71,0:09:19.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe you cut down that\Nmassive statue with just swords.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.52,0:09:20.40,Default,,0,0,0,,That was crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.04,0:09:23.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold the applause, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.18,0:09:26.06,Default,,0,0,0,,We're not in the clear just yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.24,0:09:28.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Once that cage is gone,\Nthen you can cheer.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.82,0:09:35.48,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as that stands, the main\Nthorn in our side is still out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.90,0:10:03.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.58,0:10:07.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.50,0:10:08.90,Default,,0,0,0,,That's enough, Bellamy!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.08,0:10:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Cut the crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.14,0:10:17.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.14,0:10:19.73,Default,,0,0,0,,That jerk isn't worth\Ntrading your life for!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.58,0:10:22.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I made my choice!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.80,0:10:23.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop with that crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.08,0:10:59.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you're in rough shape, Bellamy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.28,0:11:04.54,Default,,0,0,0,,If you keep fighting me like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.62,0:11:06.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You really are gonna die!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.04,0:11:16.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if I die.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.92,0:11:18.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I can take you down with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.02,0:11:21.12,Default,,0,0,0,,If nothing else?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.20,0:11:24.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe Doflamingo will think\Nof me fondly when I'm gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.72,0:11:52.34,Default,,0,0,0,,He said you're free!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.54,0:11:53.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Take it and walk!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.84,0:11:56.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine, Bellamy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.32,0:11:57.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I've had my fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.84,0:11:59.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You're free from me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.24,0:12:06.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like you've always been right,\Nyou can just go. Why risk your
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.22,0:12:12.22,Default,,0,0,0,,life listen to me Bellamy he knew
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.30,0:12:14.42,Default,,0,0,0,,you'd do this and he doesn't care
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.00,0:12:23.26,Default,,0,0,0,,that may be true but so what I ain't\Ngonna turn my back on him even if I
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.84,0:12:28.44,Default,,0,0,0,,If that's what it takes to get him\Nto respect me, then I'm gonna do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.06,0:12:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You big liar!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.54,0:12:32.01,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't about loyalty!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.36,0:12:35.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It's about your pride!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.64,0:12:42.52,Default,,0,0,0,,If you have it all figured out,\Nthen shut up and fight me already!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.62,0:12:44.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll die for nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.36,0:12:50.66,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the end of the road for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.10,0:12:54.04,Default,,0,0,0,,No, this is what I want.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.12,0:12:55.88,Default,,0,0,0,,To be killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.86,0:13:00.30,Default,,0,0,0,,By the only other man I ever respected.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.18,0:13:07.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.22,0:13:10.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.52,0:13:17.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Bellamy did change.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.18,0:13:19.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You take that back now!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.28,0:13:21.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You now have changed, Bellamy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.94,0:13:22.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You're my friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.28,0:13:27.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Straw Hats.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.28,0:13:33.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hats!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.36,0:13:35.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.38,0:13:39.04,Default,,0,0,0,,If you won't take me seriously,\Nthen I have no other choice!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.28,0:13:42.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't think I won't kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.98,0:13:46.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop being such a coward!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.30,0:13:47.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Put your soaps up already!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.28,0:13:50.11,Default,,0,0,0,,This is it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.19,0:13:52.72,Default,,0,0,0,,One final blow and it's all over!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.28,0:13:57.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Go to hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.28,0:14:04.52,Default,,0,0,0,,One last chance to do this, Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.14,0:14:07.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.28,0:14:10.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for calling me a friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.78,0:14:49.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I know I'm pitiful, I know\NI looked up to the wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.28,0:14:51.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't need to hear it from you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.04,0:14:59.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to hold on to something!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.42,0:15:02.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Even a loser like me has some dignity!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.54,0:15:18.54,Default,,0,0,0,,To Flamengo!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.56,0:15:31.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I can hear the howling of a wild cur.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.26,0:15:35.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you limp on up here?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.36,0:15:38.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.27,0:15:39.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Your buddy's on his way.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.18,0:15:41.92,Default,,0,0,0,,This is going to be good.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.74,0:15:45.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure he'll be surprised to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.02,0:15:47.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Or rather, your corpse.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.36,0:16:06.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Take it easy, Law. Rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.42,0:16:17.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Clearly, you've lost this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.02,0:16:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Fight both of us?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.08,0:16:20.43,Default,,0,0,0,,What were you thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.94,0:16:21.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.14,0:16:23.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm more than enough for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.74,0:16:29.16,Default,,0,0,0,,And Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.60,0:16:31.24,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a bit busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.02,0:16:32.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Still,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.93,0:16:35.31,Default,,0,0,0,,shame he doesn't have the guts to put that
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.40,0:16:37.87,Default,,0,0,0,,so-called friend of his out of his misery.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.16,0:16:40.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Otherwise, he might have saved you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.58,0:16:43.72,Default,,0,0,0,,What a poor naïve toad.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.00,0:16:46.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Born into the hell known as White Town.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.18,0:16:51.22,Default,,0,0,0,,A bleak future awaited you since boyhood.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.50,0:16:57.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, in a twist of fate, you were\Nled to my younger brother, Couran.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.38,0:17:03.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Which managed to draw your life out a\Nbit longer But now you're nothing more
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.44,0:17:08.86,Default,,0,0,0,,than his vindictive ghost a revenge\Ndriven fool kept alive by hatred alone
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.46,0:17:12.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You've really made the\Nmost out of the rotten hand
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.48,0:17:17.56,Default,,0,0,0,,fate dealt you still your\Ntenacity won't save you now
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.86,0:17:21.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Thirteen years down the drain.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.34,0:17:23.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I do pity you in a way a
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.24,0:17:25.26,Default,,0,0,0,,wasted life
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.38,0:17:33.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Within moments, you'll be\Nfood for the worms. You
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.34,0:17:39.64,Default,,0,0,0,,worked hard but for what well\Nit doesn't have to be for
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.72,0:17:45.56,Default,,0,0,0,,nothing trafalgar d water
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.64,0:17:51.08,Default,,0,0,0,,law come on don't let that
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.16,0:17:56.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Power go to waste. This is\Nyour final shot, so listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.30,0:18:02.12,Default,,0,0,0,,you've been given a chance\Nto change this world so do
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.20,0:18:06.34,Default,,0,0,0,,the perpetual youth surgery\Nput that abob fruit to good
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.42,0:18:10.84,Default,,0,0,0,,use then you die and since
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.92,0:18:13.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a fair man in exchange
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.44,0:18:18.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll grant you whatever you\Ndesire. I mean that would
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.40,0:18:25.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Be a tough deal for me to pass all.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.94,0:18:31.30,Default,,0,0,0,,right i'm in you're smarter than i
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.38,0:18:37.12,Default,,0,0,0,,thought la helping us out goofy's\Ngonna be eternally grateful whatever
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.20,0:18:43.76,Default,,0,0,0,,my wish is for you to bring back\Ncora and when you're done i want you
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.84,0:18:48.26,Default,,0,0,0,,to lick the asses of every last person\Nin this kingdom you think i'm no
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.52,0:18:51.35,Default,,0,0,0,,match for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.43,0:18:52.57,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all in the bag?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.66,0:18:53.56,Default,,0,0,0,,We're a joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.64,0:18:55.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's the truth, Doflamingo.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.30,0:18:57.52,Default,,0,0,0,,When you lose,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.02,0:19:00.28,Default,,0,0,0,,don't act shocked.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.36,0:19:04.89,Default,,0,0,0,,The Straw Hat Pirates have performed\Ncountless miracles along their journeys.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.10,0:19:10.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone like you never had\Na chance of stopping them.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.08,0:19:14.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Also, you're wrong if you\Nthink you can Get Caesar back.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.06,0:19:20.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Show respect—that,\Nstuffy you're talking to!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.38,0:19:21.21,Default,,0,0,0,,What
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.62,0:19:24.58,Default,,0,0,0,,you don't realize is that it's\Nyour head on the chopping?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.66,0:19:25.49,Default,,0,0,0,,chopping
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.40,0:19:47.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, your jacket, it says\NCorazon, are you mocking me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.58,0:19:52.10,Default,,0,0,0,,And the heart pirates,\Nyou think I didn't notice?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.42,0:19:54.30,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you trying to say here?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.52,0:19:58.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You refuse to accept the heart seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.78,0:20:01.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you bear the mark\Nof the heart anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.38,0:20:03.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.42,0:20:14.26,Default,,0,0,0,,How insufferable.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.82,0:20:24.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Law, Corazon, that's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.08,0:20:26.96,Default,,0,0,0,,This ends here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.38,0:20:31.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Your crusade is dead and gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.70,0:20:39.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm finally free of this burden.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.82,0:20:40.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm free!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.08,0:20:56.08,Default,,0,0,0,,He can't proceed.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.32,0:20:57.85,Default,,0,0,0,,He has taken down Bellamy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.68,0:20:59.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Well done.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.80,0:21:02.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Now there are only two\Nhigher-ups left remaining.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.36,0:21:03.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep strong, Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.88,0:21:08.44,Default,,0,0,0,,He's making great strides. However,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.94,0:21:13.78,Default,,0,0,0,,the final obstacles awaiting him are\Ntrouble, and, of course, Doflamingo himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.38,0:21:19.21,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.44,0:21:21.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Viola!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.35,0:21:22.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.98,0:21:27.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Viola?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.89,0:21:29.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I have terrible news.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.70,0:21:31.00,Default,,0,0,0,,We're down a man too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.14,0:21:34.32,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.62,0:21:35.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Is someone in trouble?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.72,0:21:38.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Trafalgar Law.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.26,0:22:05.32,Default,,0,0,0,,King Rick?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.54,0:22:09.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Despite our victories, the kingdom\Nis in great danger. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.94,0:22:12.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Citizens may still require our aid.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.30,0:22:13.60,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't rest yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.02,0:22:15.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, I'm coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.08,0:22:19.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, me too! I'm joining\Nyou. Count me in. Me too!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.48,0:22:21.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.66,0:22:22.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Let us descend into town.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.94,0:22:26.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It is not too late to minimize\Nthe casualties further true.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.94,0:22:29.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if we can't fight\Nwe can still help out
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.04,0:22:38.96,Default,,0,0,0,,So what's the next step.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.46,0:22:47.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's wrap this up, sound good? Trouble!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.20,0:22:56.03,Default,,0,0,0,,TOPLAMENKO!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.26,0:23:08.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Took you long enough, Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.28,0:23:11.28,Default,,0,0,0,,How's dear old Bellamy doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.10,0:23:16.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that he has his freedom...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.44,0:23:17.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't play dumb!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.80,0:23:19.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You set this all up!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.46,0:23:28.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You knew he'd never run away.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.84,0:23:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Come, come.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.26,0:23:32.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Come, come.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.10,0:23:36.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Spiderweb spread out.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.98,0:23:41.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.89,0:23:45.16,Default,,0,0,0,,So I guess Bellamy didn't\Nhightail it after all?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.30,0:23:48.88,Default,,0,0,0,,What's so funny?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.74,0:23:56.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Now come, come!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.60,0:23:59.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Hulk got my gun!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.94,0:24:19.78,Default,,0,0,0,,And now, break white!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.96,0:24:37.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Traffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.64,0:24:39.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's all this blood coming from?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.94,0:24:41.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Where'd your arm go?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.06,0:24:44.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Traffy! Hang in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.90,0:24:46.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Traffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.22,0:24:54.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What you can't tell—he's dead. Liar!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.34,0:24:58.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Just look at him.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.20,0:25:00.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Trafi was holding out\Nfor you to come through.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.84,0:25:01.92,Default,,0,0,0,,What a damn shame!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.00,0:25:02.83,Default,,0,0,0,,He
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.38,0:25:09.40,Default,,0,0,0,,did mention that you're quite\Nthe miracle worker, Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.48,0:25:10.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.46,0:25:12.29,Default,,0,0,0,,don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.37,0:25:14.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You didn't impress me\Nmuch in our first fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.80,0:25:15.63,Default,,0,0,0,,fight
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.14,0:25:19.66,Default,,0,0,0,,And I doubt you stand a\Nchance against both of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.74,0:25:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll pay for this, you bastards!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.30,0:25:39.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.30,0:25:40.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold your positions!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.66,0:25:53.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.90,0:25:54.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's back up!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.16,0:26:00.24,Default,,0,0,0,,That's shrinking!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.80,0:26:09.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll be joining your\Npal, Law, in no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.06,0:26:14.34,Default,,0,0,0,,And now...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.42,0:26:17.14,Default,,0,0,0,,We end this game. Mingo!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.26,0:26:19.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.44,0:26:23.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen carefully, Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.08,0:26:35.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.10,0:26:51.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It's moving! I knew it!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.94,0:26:58.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Those killer strings!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.58,0:26:59.58,Default,,0,0,0,,They're closing ends!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.66,0:27:00.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Run away!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.20,0:27:11.86,Default,,0,0,0,,The end of the town isn't safer anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.96,0:27:19.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, go, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.66,0:27:24.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Say thank you in the west!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.46,0:27:28.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Reporting from Carta in the east.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.52,0:27:31.34,Default,,0,0,0,,The birdcage is moving,\Nas the report said.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.90,0:27:40.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone is fleeing to\Ndowntown in a panic!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.62,0:27:44.36,Default,,0,0,0,,No one will survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.76,0:27:48.17,Default,,0,0,0,,They'll all be butchered sooner or later.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.80,0:27:53.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.46,0:27:54.96,Default,,0,0,0,,The rules have changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.26,0:27:57.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I've decided to play a different game now.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.08,0:28:00.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You're still calling this a game?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.88,0:28:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Just listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.86,0:28:10.84,Default,,0,0,0,,The birdcage that surrounds\Nthe kingdom started shrinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.16,0:28:13.36,Default,,0,0,0,,pulling into the center bit by bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.62,0:28:19.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Think of it like a giant\Numbrella closing slowly.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.64,0:28:26.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll cut through everything in\Nits path. The entire kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.22,0:28:32.48,Default,,0,0,0,,As for how long that'll take,\Nwell, about an hour, I'd say.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.54,0:28:41.14,Default,,0,0,0,,They have nowhere left\Nto go; they're finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.74,0:28:46.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Check for citizens at the edge of the\Nkingdom and bring them to the center quickly,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.54,0:28:47.44,Default,,0,0,0,,yes sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.26,0:28:55.96,Default,,0,0,0,,We've moved the people at risk\Nfrom the edges of the kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.04,0:28:57.57,Default,,0,0,0,,but we have to keep going.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.16,0:28:59.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.26,0:29:00.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Follow after me!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.52,0:29:01.70,Default,,0,0,0,,The strings are coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.78,0:29:02.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.90,0:29:06.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, could somebody untie us, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.58,0:29:08.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Just the feet is fine, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.98,0:29:09.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Have mercy!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.22,0:29:11.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.74,0:29:13.57,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.65,0:29:15.60,Default,,0,0,0,,The birdcage is freaking? No!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.88,0:29:19.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, birdcage, stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.42,0:29:20.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems to be so.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.64,0:29:21.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.55,0:29:22.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What should we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.74,0:29:24.52,Default,,0,0,0,,We've suffered enough already!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.96,0:29:25.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Zoro, help!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.90,0:29:28.48,Default,,0,0,0,,And we were winning\Nall of our fights, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.64,0:29:31.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't pull the rug\Nout from under us now!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.38,0:29:33.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.86,0:29:36.98,Default,,0,0,0,,We finally made it out of that\Ndungeon after all this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.06,0:29:38.74,Default,,0,0,0,,And now we're in a new cage?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.88,0:29:41.59,Default,,0,0,0,,There has to be some\Nplace safe we can run to!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.16,0:29:44.26,Default,,0,0,0,,How could you do such a heartless thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.34,0:29:47.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Is there no depth you\Nwon't sink to, Doflamingo?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.30,0:29:51.07,Default,,0,0,0,,The birdcage is going to dice up\Nthe whole kingdom at this rate!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.48,0:29:52.66,Default,,0,0,0,,We're all done for!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.90,0:29:53.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Our home, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.44,0:30:01.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm seeing a lot of smoke and\Nhearing a lot of rumbling.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.80,0:30:03.45,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way this is good.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.88,0:30:05.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry it up, Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.84,0:30:08.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Just kick his ass and\Nget this mess over with!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.88,0:30:10.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You're our only hope! Indeed!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.22,0:30:12.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Thwart him swiftly, my friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.32,0:30:17.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It must be difficult to have so\Nmuch resting on one man's shoulders.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.58,0:30:20.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.52,0:30:22.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Please prevail!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.26,0:30:25.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone will die if you do not succeed!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.34,0:30:35.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't spare a single\Nrotten life in this kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.64,0:30:42.92,Default,,0,0,0,,They aren't worth a thing to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.28,0:30:47.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Not since they discovered the truth\Nabout how I've been running this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.86,0:30:59.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Every building, every\Nperson, every animal,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.20,0:31:02.36,Default,,0,0,0,,all your miserable little allies,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.44,0:31:07.16,Default,,0,0,0,,and finally you will die.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.66,0:31:19.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Although I suppose some of\Nyour friends have died already,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.06,0:31:21.38,Default,,0,0,0,,the good doctor passed away.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.46,0:31:22.58,Default,,0,0,0,,just a moment ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.68,0:31:29.40,Default,,0,0,0,,So much for your pirate\Nalliance with dear old Traffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.76,0:31:39.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, but no need to worry about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.74,0:31:41.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll build a new kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.70,0:31:43.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, screw that.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.96,0:31:46.94,Default,,0,0,0,,All I gotta do is kick your ass\Nand everything will be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.02,0:31:51.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm starting to think that you're not\Npaying attention to me, Straw Hat?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.12,0:31:52.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll never learn, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.16,0:31:54.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Bullet strip
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.88,0:31:59.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gone. Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.06,0:32:01.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll die just like Loh.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.92,0:32:03.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Shambles.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.80,0:32:14.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but nobody's dying here except you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.40,0:32:16.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.84,0:32:29.64,Default,,0,0,0,,This operation will destroy\Nyour body from the inside out.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.16,0:32:35.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Give a knife!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.12,0:32:57.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You were supposed to be\Ndead, you big cheater!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.10,0:33:02.00,Default,,0,0,0,,And how can you do an app-a-tag\Nwithout making a room? I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.22,0:33:03.88,Default,,0,0,0,,We're in a room as we speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.26,0:33:07.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll shave some time\Noff my life. I'm sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.92,0:33:11.92,Default,,0,0,0,,But I made a room so big that you\Ncan't see the end of it from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.56,0:33:13.39,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.47,0:33:14.30,Default,,0,0,0,,But that's crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.84,0:33:20.86,Default,,0,0,0,,All I did was in\Npreparation for this moment!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.64,0:33:42.72,Default,,0,0,0,,It wasn't enough to kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.60,0:33:44.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Shambles!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.04,0:33:55.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Mingo!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.04,0:33:57.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.62,0:34:01.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.06,0:34:05.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen carefully, Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.92,0:34:08.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't turn around.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.58,0:34:09.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.22,0:34:15.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't defend against an attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.84,0:34:16.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm inside!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.78,0:34:22.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Even you can counteract this technique.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.74,0:34:40.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Doofy!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.96,0:34:41.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a king!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.22,0:34:44.70,Default,,0,0,0,,A king never fought to his knees!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.68,0:34:51.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You little bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.88,0:34:54.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It's no use.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.56,0:34:56.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if you kill me, you're done for.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.82,0:35:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You think I won't kill you anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.84,0:35:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You forget about me?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.62,0:35:14.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got a gun, Chester!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.46,0:35:21.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.48,0:35:29.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Dolphi!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.86,0:35:30.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.76,0:35:37.16,Default,,0,0,0,,What more? Straw Hat. Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.72,0:35:50.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Trafalgar It has to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.10,0:35:54.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Me who does this!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.62,0:36:31.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It's over, Doflamingo.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.04,0:36:36.88,Default,,0,0,0,,What have you done?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.16,0:36:38.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You're me!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.36,0:36:39.76,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.12,0:36:50.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't get in our way!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.86,0:37:02.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Your family...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.98,0:37:05.98,Default,,0,0,0,,is nothing more than people\Nyou thought you could use.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.06,0:37:10.06,Default,,0,0,0,,A bond built entirely on\Nyour own ego and convenience.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.62,0:37:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,,And your only true brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.38,0:37:15.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Who tried to stop you on\Nyour path to destruction?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.06,0:37:18.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Was murdered by you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.78,0:37:22.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause Lost finally, free now!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.68,0:37:34.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.98,0:37:36.66,Default,,0,0,0,,That was unfortunate.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.10,0:37:40.16,Default,,0,0,0,,But he was the one who betrayed me.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.74,0:37:42.70,Default,,0,0,0,,He was the one who pointed a gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.78,0:37:44.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You think I wanted that?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.62,0:37:46.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't give me that crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.90,0:37:49.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You knew damn well he\Nwouldn't pull that trigger.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.60,0:37:57.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I could have pulled it just fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.62,0:38:07.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I bet so.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.00,0:38:15.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I always knew we were the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.22,0:38:18.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to destroy everything that I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.30,0:38:22.22,Default,,0,0,0,,People, towns.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.64,0:38:25.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to burn this whole\Nworld to the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.78,0:38:28.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe so.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.44,0:38:32.26,Default,,0,0,0,,But in this case, that's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.34,0:38:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause. I'll tell you this.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.40,0:38:44.17,Default,,0,0,0,,You were the one who\Nshould have died that day.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.16,0:38:49.54,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're expecting me to say\Nsomething cold and twisted?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.62,0:38:51.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll indulge you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.34,0:38:55.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I hated Corazon.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.96,0:38:58.62,Default,,0,0,0,,He was a nuisance and an obstacle to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.70,0:39:01.38,Default,,0,0,0,,His insipid sense of justice.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.46,0:39:04.62,Default,,0,0,0,,This is worthless\Nsentimentality holding me back.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.84,0:39:06.44,Default,,0,0,0,,He wasn't worth a damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.84,0:39:10.84,Default,,0,0,0,,And that's why, when I killed\Nhim that day, I was happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.34,0:39:12.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Go to shock!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.34,0:39:17.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You go to hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.20,0:39:19.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I've heard enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.60,0:39:23.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.98,0:39:45.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.68,0:40:17.40,Default,,0,0,0,,That's our cake for ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.80,0:40:19.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't keep a straight man down!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.00,0:40:25.82,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.74,0:40:35.06,Default,,0,0,0,,If I have enough time, I can use my\Npowers to perform an operation of my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.36,0:40:39.18,Default,,0,0,0,,right now beneath the skin my strings are
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.26,0:40:42.28,Default,,0,0,0,,reconstructing the organs\Nyou so rudely damaged
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.36,0:40:46.80,Default,,0,0,0,,what the hell just takes\Ncreativity although
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.88,0:40:48.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know if I would\Ncall this It's healing.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.00,0:40:49.83,Default,,0,0,0,,exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.28,0:40:53.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You threw your life away.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.32,0:41:00.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Sticky, sticky cheese!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.28,0:41:04.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.04,0:41:07.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Stick sticker!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.24,0:41:20.24,Default,,0,0,0,,And look at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.44,0:41:22.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I still get to do the honors.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.68,0:41:30.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.44,0:41:38.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.28,0:41:49.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
